format: 3
name: a user record whose name starts with Optional is a record
class: Case
method: m
arg: d8799f05ff
expect: AGREE
note: ADR-068 D7. The reference reads the datum of a validator of this type by its spelling, which only a validator shows (Adr068TypeIdentityTest).
note: ADR-068 D13: on frontend=JAVAC this agrees with the JVM (Adr068SavedCasesOnJavacTest).
---
public class Case {
    public record OptionalThing(long value) { }

    public static long m(OptionalThing thing) {
        var copy = new OptionalThing(thing.value() + 1);
        return copy.value();
    }
}
